<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mk">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE BEAST TIPSER</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#070707;
color:white;
}

header{
background:#101010;
border-bottom:1px solid #292929;
padding:18px;
position:sticky;
top:0;
z-index:10;
}

.nav{
max-width:1100px;
margin:auto;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
}

.logo{
font-size:22px;
font-weight:900;
letter-spacing:1px;
}

.logo span{
color:#f5b400;
}

nav a{
color:#ddd;
text-decoration:none;
margin-left:20px;
font-size:14px;
}

.hero{
max-width:1100px;
margin:30px auto;
padding:20px;
}

.hero-box{
padding:45px 30px;
border:1px solid #4a3a00;
border-radius:20px;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#181818,#0b0b0b);
}

.badge{
display:inline-block;
background:#f5b400;
color:#111;
font-weight:bold;
padding:8px 12px;
border-radius:20px;
font-size:12px;
}

h1{
font-size:55px;
margin:20px 0 10px;
}

h1 span{
color:#f5b400;
}

.hero p{
color:#aaa;
max-width:650px;
line-height:1.6;
}

.button{
display:inline-block;
background:#f5b400;
color:#111;
padding:13px 20px;
border-radius:9px;
font-weight:bold;
text-decoration:none;
margin-top:10px;
}

main{
max-width:1100px;
margin:auto;
padding:0 20px 50px;
}

.title{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
margin:30px 0 15px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:15px;
}

.card{
background:#121212;
border:1px solid #292929;
border-radius:15px;
padding:20px;
}

.league{
font-size:12px;
color:#888;
text-transform:uppercase;
}

.match{
font-weight:bold;
font-size:17px;
margin:12px 0;
}

.tip{
border-top:1px solid #292929;
padding-top:13px;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
}

.odd{
color:#f5b400;
font-size:22px;
font-weight:900;
}

.confidence{
font-size:11px;
color:#999;
margin-top:4px;
}

.ticket{
background:#121212;
border:1px solid #594600;
border-radius:17px;
padding:20px;
}

.ticket-row{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
padding:14px 0;
border-bottom:1px solid #292929;
}

.total{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
font-size:21px;
font-weight:bold;
padding-top:18px;
}

.total span{
color:#f5b400;
}

.stats{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
gap:15px;
}

.stat{
background:#121212;
border:1px solid #292929;
border-radius:15px;
padding:20px;
}

.stat small{
color:#999;
}

.stat strong{
display:block;
font-size:28px;
margin-top:8px;
}

footer{
border-top:1px solid #222;
text-align:center;
color:#777;
padding:25px;
font-size:12px;
}

@media(max-width:700px){

nav{
display:none;
}

h1{
font-size:38px;
}

.grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.stats{
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
}

.hero-box{
padding:30px 20px;
}

}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="nav">

<div class="logo">
THE <span>BEAST</span> TIPSER
</div>

<nav>
<a href="#tips">ТИПОВИ</a>
<a href="#ticket">ТИКЕТ</a>
<a href="#stats">СТАТИСТИКА</a>
</nav>

</div>

</header>


<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-box">

<span class="badge">🔥 DAILY FOOTBALL TIPS</span>

<h1>
THE BEAST <span>TIPSER</span>
</h1>

<p>
Фудбалски прогнози, дневни типови и готови тикети.
Следи ги најдобрите типови на едно место.
</p>

<a class="button" href="#tips">
ПОГЛЕДНИ ТИПОВИ
</a>

</div>

</section>


<main>

<section id="tips">

<div class="title">

<h2>🔥 Денешни типови</h2>

<span>12.08.2026</span>

</div>


<div class="grid">


<div class="card">

<div class="league">
Premier League
</div>

<div class="match">
Arsenal – Chelsea
</div>

<div class="tip">

<div>

<b>1X</b>

<div class="confidence">
Confidence 8/10
</div>

</div>

<div class="odd">
1.32
</div>

</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="league">
La Liga
</div>

<div class="match">
Barcelona – Sevilla
</div>

<div class="tip">

<div>

<b>Over 2.5</b>

<div class="confidence">
Confidence 9/10
</div>

</div>

<div class="odd">
1.55
</div>

</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="league">
Serie A
</div>

<div class="match">
Inter – Lazio
</div>

<div class="tip">

<div>

<b>1</b>

<div class="confidence">
Confidence 8/10
</div>

</div>

<div class="odd">
1.48
</div>

</div>

</div>


</div>

</section>


<section id="ticket">

<div class="title">

<h2>🎫 BEAST TICKET</h2>

</div>

<div class="ticket">

<div class="ticket-row">
<span>Arsenal – Chelsea · 1X</span>
<b>1.32</b>
</div>

<div class="ticket-row">
<span>Barcelona – Sevilla · Over 2.5</span>
<b>1.55</b>
</div>

<div class="ticket-row">
<span>Inter – Lazio · 1</span>
<b>1.48</b>
</div>

<div class="total">

<span>ВКУПЕН КОЕФИЦИЕНТ</span>

<b>3.03</b>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="stats">

<div class="title">

<h2>📊 Статистика</h2>

</div>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<small>Добитни</small>
<strong>—</strong>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Промашени</small>
<strong>—</strong>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Win Rate</small>
<strong>—</strong>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>ROI</small>
<strong>—</strong>
</div>

</div>

</section>

</main>


<footer>

THE BEAST TIPSER © 2026

</footer>

</body>
</html>
